    "passage": "Cornell & Bright Financial Services\n820 Harlow Street, Suite 400, Denton Falls\n\nFebruary 12\n\nMs. Adriana Solis\n34 Pinewood Terrace\nDenton Falls\n\nDear Ms. Solis,\n\nThank you for being a valued client of Cornell & Bright for the past six years. I am writing to inform you of an upcoming change to our client rewards program, effective April 1.\n\nUnder the current program, clients earn one reward point for every $100 held in managed accounts, and points can be redeemed only for reduced advisory fees. Beginning in April, points may also be exchanged for complimentary financial planning sessions, tickets to our quarterly investment seminars, and gift cards from participating local businesses. In addition, clients who have been with us for five years or longer, such as yourself, will automatically receive a 20 percent bonus on all points earned after the change takes effect.\n\nYour current point balance of 2,340 will carry over unchanged. To explore the new redemption options, log in to your account at www.cornellbright.com/rewards or call your advisor, Marcus Webb, at 555-0188, extension 24.\n\nWe appreciate your continued trust in our firm.\n\nSincerely,\n\nHelena Park\nDirector of Client Relations\nCornell & Bright Financial Services",
